{"product_id":"goddess-of-secrets","title":"Goddess of Secrets","description":"\u003cp\u003eKumari is back from the world beyond, but everything has changed. The palace is full of danger, her father is seriously ill and the Hidden Kingdon lies in crisis. What's a girl goddess to do? Kumari's still struggling to gain her Powers, while her quest to avenge her beloved Mamma seem tougher than ever. And she's missing her friends in New York - back here she can trust no one, except her bolshie baby vulture, Badmash. When disaster strikes, Kumari has to work fast and in secret. Can she outwit the thieves of Happiness to save Papa and her people? Or will she have to sacrifice her own life for the kingdom she loves? AUTHOR: Amanda Lee is a journalist, nivelist, actress and broadcaster, appearing regularly on BBC and LBC radio. She has a number of film and TV projects currently in development.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Amanda Lees\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781853409899\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 279\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45807532703897,"sku":"17RB-19781853409899","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f3c542d8cc7_Goddess_of_Secrets_Amanda_Lees.jpg?v=1760971783","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/goddess-of-secrets","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}